1.0.2 2026-07-22
  - - Removed participant-generated reminder phrase text from all task events files; replaced with thought_uid, a stable within-participant identifier - Replaced per-run events sidecars, which described a different study, with a single corrected task-PDT_events.json at the dataset root - Added pre-scan thought ratings at stimuli/thought_ratings.tsv, keyed by participant_id and thought_uid - Added phenotype/ with ADIS-5 diagnoses and PTQ and PSWQ scores - Expanded participants.tsv with race, ethnicity, trait totals, diagnosis count, and coded analysis-exclusion status - Corrected participants.json (gender levels did not match the data; age incorrectly specified as categorical) - Corrected scanner model in README (Prisma, not Verio) - Replaced the missing-value token NA with n/a in all events files, per BIDS - Removed sub-367 from participants.tsv (no imaging or questionnaire data)
